2. Introduction
-----------------------------------

CUSTOM CHARACTER SHEET STAT TRACKER (StatTrack) is a tool for tabletop and
role-playing fans who are tired of running out of readable paper space and
erasers. StatTrack allows users to create and maintain custom character sheets
on their computer using the command-line. This enables them to add and remove
fields as necessary for any special case. Template files are included to start.

-----------------------------------
3. Installation
-----------------------------------

Windows
-------
Create a folder for StatTrack, download the st.zip file from the GitHub
repository, and extract all files into the created folder. Then, run st.exe.

